<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos year sales revenue up 8.6 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos year sales revenue up 8.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas producer Santos Ltd said its full year sales revenue for calendar 1996 rose 8.6 percent to A$729.2 million.  </p>
<p>Sales revenue in the fourth quarter rose 24.4 percent on the same quarter in 1995 to A$207.2 million, a quarterly record.</p>
<p>Sales volumes rose 10 percent to 9.9 million barrels of oil equivalent (BOE) and production volume rose 8.8 percent to 9.8 million BOE.</p>
<p>Managing director Ross Adler said the fourth quarter reflected Santos' positive year. For the full year, sales volume increased 4.1 percent over 1995 to 38.3 million BOE and production volume 6.4 percent to 39.2 million BOE.</p>
</text>
